bluejetty:00081827:ios.description:
You are an unemployed dog trainer and you have nothing. You need to make the right choices and constantly overcome various challenges in life. Starting from training your first dog, collecting various dogs, training them, teaching them various skills, and ultimately becoming a top dog trainer.
In the game, you can experience the life journey of a dog trainer:
-Collect various types of dogs;
-Train your dog;
-Beauty and health care for dogs;
-Entertainment with dogs;
-Learn various professional knowledge about raising dogs;
Come and play with the dogs!

